In this fiery episode of Surrounded, Candace Owens takes on 20 feminists in a high-stakes debate. From challenging feminism’s legacy to questioning the sexual revolution, Owens defends four bold claims. Will she hold her ground or be outnumbered by the opposition? 
Watch the full showdown and decide for yourself.

